  "description": "Three keyed submits of the same text under dailyRateLimit 2 (a tightening: the default of 10 would need 11 submits). The interleaved get steps are load-bearing: each is a real sync that moves the previous intent executing to completed, which is what the rate rule counts; without them the limit is defeatable (see the README Finding and src/e2e/limits-rate-limit-toctou.test.ts). The third intent is rejected with daily_rate_limit_exceeded.",
  "customerId": "cust_evals_1",
